  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nThe [Compression Dictionary Transport](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-compression-dictionary/) spec defines a link relation for loading compression dictionaries. The HTML implementation of the link relation should be spec'd.\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\nNone.\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\nDefine the compression-dictionary link relation behavior to mirror the behavior of a prefetch except for passing \"compression-dictionary\" through to fetch as the initiator and defaulting crossorigin to \"anonymous\" (instead of No-cors).\n\n### Anything else?\n\n_No response_",
